---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="contact" class="bg-text text-white pt-16 pb-8">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-8">
            <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1">
                <h3 class="text-white text-xl font-semibold mb-4">AgriFlow</h3>
                <p class="text-white/70">Solution de gestion agricole développée par ShiroUsagiLabo, conçue pour simplifier le quotidien des agriculteurs.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4 class="text-white text-lg font-medium mb-4">Navigation</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-2">
                    <li><a href="#fonctionnalites" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Fonctionnalités</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#avantages" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Avantages</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#demo" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Démonstration</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/pricing" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Tarifs</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4 class="text-white text-lg font-medium mb-4">Légal</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-2">
                    <li><a href="/privacy" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Politique de confidentialité</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/terms" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Conditions d'utilisation</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/mentions" class="text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">Mentions légales</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h4 class="text-white text-lg font-medium mb-4">Contact</h4>
                <p class="text-white/70 mb-2">Email: contact@agriflow.com</p>
                <p class="text-white/70 mb-4">Téléphone: +33 (0)1 23 45 67 89</p>
                <div class="flex gap-4">
                    <a href="#" aria-label="Facebook" class="text-2xl">📱</a>
                    <a href="#" aria-label="Twitter" class="text-2xl">📱</a>
                    <a href="#" aria-label="Instagram" class="text-2xl">📱</a>
                    <a href="#" aria-label="LinkedIn" class="text-2xl">📱</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-8 border-t border-white/10 text-center text-white/50">
            <p>&copy; {currentYear} AgriFlow. Tous droits réservés.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer> 